Subject: [PATCH] Own software AP VLAN ports and bridge-selected forwarding

Keep firmware VAP and key ownership on the parent BSS. Bind software
four-address children to exact station incarnations and select RX by SID.
The Linux bridge owns bridged multicast policy; preserve the native group
path for unconverted frames and keep child peers out of parent delivery.

